From bad457e0c10ae0da051d4f118ca9c9d2fc191958 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:31:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] system: add Play Integrity toggle and keybox settings

Add a Play Integrity preference screen under System settings to toggle automatic DroidGuard spoofing, trigger an immediate Pixel Canary fingerprint refresh, and load or remove keybox.xml via document picker.

Change-Id: Ia01d027fe200d0e68ab10ba01482b24ead1ad113
